# headset-locals v1.0.0

## Forms

### `(head …)`

A global form, reachable from the resource slot by the additive fallback.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:text` | `string` | yes | — | — |

### `(bind-group-layout …)`

A layout whose entries are slot-local, behind a closed head-set.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:name` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: `form: (entry …, local)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `entry` | at least 1 |

#### `(entry …)`

One binding. Its own positional slot is closed the same way.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:binding` | `number` | yes | — | — |

Positional children: `form: (buffer …, local) | (storage-texture …, local) | (head …)`.

| Head | Count |
| --- | --- |
| `buffer` | at most 1 |
| `storage-texture` | any |
| `head` | any |

#### `(buffer …)`

Slot-local buffer resource; no global `buffer` exists.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:kind` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

#### `(storage-texture …)`

Slot-local storage texture; no global one exists either.

| Key | Type | Required | Default | Constraints |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `:format` | `symbol` | yes | — | — |

## Value kinds

### bgl-resource

What one binding may hold. Local bodies, one global, and counts.

Type: `form: (buffer …) | (storage-texture …) | (head …)`.

### bgl-entry-item

One entry of a layout. Exactly one `entry` is required.

Type: `form: (entry …)`.
